# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contact Form Configuration
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# You can use either Web3Forms (simplest) or EmailJS.
# Set the variables below, copy this file to '.env', and restart the dev server.

# Option 1: Web3Forms (Recommended, easiest to set up)
# 1. Visit https://web3forms.com/ and enter your email (intisarmuhib303@gmail.com)
# 2. You will receive an access key in your email
# 3. Paste the access key below:
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=

# Option 2: EmailJS
# 1. Create an account at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an email service and a template pointing to intisarmuhib303@gmail.com
# 3. Fill in the credentials below:
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
